      "implementation_notes": [
        "Direct execution of mem0ai/mem0@84bf468176f0c5e82493bb95aec5484eb2d92bc1; installed native Python source files are SHA256 checked before setup.",
        "Provider factories bridge public LLM/embedding services; native prompt construction, batch calls, semantic entity merge, BM25 and hybrid ranking are unchanged.",
        "The pinned upstream default is additive extraction, not the paper-era four-operation classic pipeline. Historical simplified implementations and checkpoints are deliberately unsupported.",
        "Native telemetry is disabled; native config and both Qdrant collections are initialized under adapter-owned storage. Setup prewarms NLP/BM25 and fails on unavailable native components.",
        "save/load contain compressed complete Qdrant and SQLite history/messages files; restore does not replay models or renormalize vectors. Public reset additionally clears selected recent-message context/entity links.",
        "Frozen reads use snapshot restoration because upstream Qdrant local cosine search normalizes stored dense arrays in place; the adapter preserves exact live dtypes/order alongside all persistent DB files."
      ],
      "config_schema": {
